=== list with base annotation accepts mixed subclass elements
class Stmt:
    pass
class Assign(Stmt):
    pass
class Return(Stmt):
    pass
def f() -> list[Stmt]:
    xs: list[Stmt] = [Assign()]
    xs.append(Return())
    return xs
---
ok
---

=== list with base annotation extend with base type
class Stmt:
    pass
class Assign(Stmt):
    pass
def get_stmts() -> list[Stmt]:
    return []
def f() -> list[Stmt]:
    xs: list[Stmt] = [Assign()]
    xs.extend(get_stmts())
    return xs
---
ok
---

